m(X_scaled)","position":{"start":{"line":220,"column":1},"end":{"line":220,"column":1}},"key":"n3BXzLLa8x"},{"type":"text","value":"メソッドは、標準化されたデータに対してPCAを適合させ、そのPCA変換を適用します。\n結果として、元の13次元のデータが2次元に削減され、","position":{"start":{"line":220,"column":1},"end":{"line":220,"column":1}},"key":"cGpztmQiZ0"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"X_pca","position":{"start":{"line":220,"column":1},"end":{"line":220,"column":1}},"key":"JVxECmIENW"},{"type":"text","value":"に代入されます。","position":{"start":{"line":220,"column":1},"end":{"line":220,"column":1}},"key":"wF1UN4doba"}],"key":"y2VR7xJoAv"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":225,"column":1},"end":{"line":225,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"t-SNE (t-Distributed Stochastic Neighbor Embedding)","position":{"start":{"line":225,"column":1},"end":{"line":225,"column":1}},"key":"YnCn9Nbgxt"}],"identifier":"t-sne-t-distributed-stochastic-neighbor-embedding","label":"t-SNE (t-Distributed Stochastic Neighbor Embedding)","html_id":"t-sne-t-distributed-stochastic-neighbor-embedding","implicit":true,"enumerator":"10.2","key":"vkLtFFdaFQ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":227,"column":1},"end":{"line":229,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"次元削減の手法として、PCA以外に","position":{"start":{"line":227,"column":1},"end":{"line":227,"column":1}},"key":"dLrqFmeGtm"},{"type":"span","children":[{"type":"text","value":"t-SNE","key":"KAtkPv94HO"}],"indexEntries":[{"entry":"t-SNE","emphasis":false}],"label":"index-Tgw4EWw5G6","identifier":"index-tgw4eww5g6","html_id":"index-tgw4eww5g6","key":"j0kx33sHN0"},{"type":"text","value":"があります。\nt-SNEは高次元データを低次元に変換する次元削減手法で、PCAが線形変換であるのに対し、非線形の変換を行います。\nこれにより、より複雑なデータ構造や関係性を表現できます。","position":{"start":{"line":227,"column":1},"end":{"line":227,"column":1}},"key":"YBI6MCiUl8"}],"key":"h2NYbjK3pf"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":231,"column":1},"end":{"line":233,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"t-SNEの基本原理は「似ているデータ同士を近くに、異なるデータ同士を遠くに配置する」というものです。\n高次元空間での距離関係を確率分布として捉え、その分布をできるだけ保存するように低次元空間へ写像します。\nこの特性により、クラスター構造の可視化に特に優れています。","position":{"start":{"line":231,"column":1},"end":{"line":231,"column":1}},"key":"kfevOwlQTR"}],"key":"I7S9p2d4Yn"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":235,"column":1},"end":{"line":237,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"PCAは各主成分が元の特徴量の線形結合として解釈でき、結果の解釈が容易です。\n一方、t-SNEは結果の解釈が難しく、視覚化のために主に使用されます。\nそのため、クラスタリング結果の可視化や複雑なデータセットの探索的分析で用いられます。","position":{"start":{"line":235,"column":1},"end":{"line":235,"column":1}},"key":"K7LHvCPY66"}],"key":"AzcenaVK9M"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":239,"column":1},"end":{"line":241,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"計算コストの面でもPCAとt-SNEには違いがあります。\nt-SNEはPCAよりも計算コストが高く、特に大規模なデータセットでは処理時間が長くなる傾向があります。\nそのため、実務では「まずPCAで全体像を把握し、その後t-SNEでより詳細な構造を探る」という段階的なアプローチがよく取られます。","position":{"start":{"line":239,"column":1},"end":{"line":239,"column":1}},"key":"iNJvQVoOcj"}],"key":"mcbb5oqA5D"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":243,"column":1},"end":{"line":243,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"では、t-SNEを使ってワインデータを可視化してみましょう。","position":{"start":{"line":243,"column":1},"end":{"line":243,"column":1}},"key":"sl1XRAesQk"}],"key":"Y9nrQfLDs1"}],"key":"ER1ZQoMQgg"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"from sklearn.manifold import TSNE\n\ntsne = TSNE(n_components=2, random_state=42)\nX_tsne = tsne.fit_transform(X_scaled)\n\ndf_tsne = pd.DataFrame(data=X_tsne, columns=['TSNE1', 'TSNE2'])\ndf_tsne['target'] = df['target']\ndf_tsne['target_names'] = df['target'].map(dict(enumerate(wine.target_names)))\n\nsns.scatterplot(data=df_tsne, x='TSNE1', y='TSNE2', hue='target_names', palette='deep')\nplt.title('t-SNE変換後のワインデータ')\nplt.xlabel('t-SNE1')\nplt.ylabel('t-SNE2')\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()","showLineNumbers":true,"key":"VdX5I8Dmr7"},{"type":"outputs","id":"lr3vRkmp2mwqovm2kfzQN","children":[{"ty